ALL.append(q(462,"Hard","CSE-style: Which of the following is a grammatically complete and correct sentence?",["The memorandum issued by the department head regarding the new attendance policy for all regular employees.","Despite the fact that the committee had already approved the budget allocation for the infrastructure project.","The Civil Service Commission has announced that the examination results will be released next month.","Running the government agency efficiently while maintaining transparency and accountability to the public."],"The Civil Service Commission has announced that the examination results will be released next month.","Clear S-V structure with a noun clause as DO. The others lack main verbs or are dependent clauses.",["complete sentence","CSE-style","elimination"]))
